post.description:
Starts the customer's portal session (a separate sign-in from staff);
a customer is created on first sign-in. Fails with 422 `otp_wrong`
or `otp_expired`.

With `from_register` the cash also leaves the branch's open shift;
fails with 409 `shift_not_open`, `shift_cash_insufficient` or
`expense_register_needs_cash`.

get.description:
Where the browser connects for live board updates (Reverb, Pusher
protocol). `enabled` is false when no socket server is configured;
screens then refresh on a timer.

Orders and sales taken in today, money collected today, the
workshop's load, and the last 14 days. Amounts are whole rials;
days follow the organization's time zone.
